                  \&amp; \nearrow &amp; &amp; \nwarrow &amp; &amp; \nearrow &amp; &amp; \nwarrow &amp; \\
                  \\mathbf{1} &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; \mathbf{1} &amp; &amp; &amp; &amp; \mathbf{1}
                  }
          %p
            The universal property of pushouts, together with those of the initial and terminal objects
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
